From: IRPlayer maintainers <maintainers@irplayer.local>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/http: scope automatic cookies to their origin

Keep origin metadata with cookies learned from Set-Cookie so redirects,
reconnects, and nested protocol contexts cannot turn a host-only cookie into
a global cookie. Validate Domain attributes at receipt and use RFC label and
path boundaries when selecting outbound cookies. Also honor Secure and derive
the RFC default Path. Explicit caller-supplied cookie strings retain their
historical behavior when they have no automatic origin marker.

